WEBVTT

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:10.040
What is that?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.450
That's the final form of the Dark Falz.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.430
Senpai!

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.960
Rina-senpai!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>Last Quest:    The RPG That Crosses Boundaries</b>

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.460
Rina-senpai.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:09.900
What's that?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:10.650
They're here.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.650
The ARKS Interception Silhouette.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.480
It's the ARKS's strongest weapon.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.590
We have to hurry.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:32.330
Hurry?

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.400
The AIS is the advance force of the ARKS.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.840
It means the ARKS's all-out attack has begun.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.120
No way. In an instant...

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.110
The entire AIS advance force has been annihilated.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.860
There's no need to panic.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.110
Move to phase two immediately.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.300
Proceeding to phase two of the mission.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.590
Photon laser, standby.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.960
Target locked.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.240
Charging sequence initiated.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.060
Charging complete.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.920
Target: enemy Dark Falz Apprentice.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:21.970
Fire!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.010
Wait, Itsuki!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.490
What are you doing?

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.030
If you're not careful, 
you'll be struck by its attacks.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.780
It's too damaged too move right now,

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.910
but it'll regenerate
and start moving again.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.630
Just sitting here won't change anything!

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.760
I came to save Rina, too.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:34.530
Then let me go.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.300
But...

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.370
I won't let you die. I swear it.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.380
You must rescue Rina alive.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:45.050
For our friends who cleared 
this path for us, too.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.540
That is your mission.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.800
My mission?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.550
Making the school festival a success 
with the student council president.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.810
Isn't that right, Vice President?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.500
The drama club's performance will begin
in the audiovisual room shortly.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.310
Voting for Miss Seiga Academy 
will be closing soon.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.840
You'd better come back.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.790
<b>School Festival Materials
2025 Pictures</b>

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.790
<b>School Festival Materials
Last Year's Pictures</b>

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:22.780
The members of the Hoshihama Academy 
student council should be arriving soon.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.160
I'll handle them.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.660
We finished bringing in the fireworks.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.060
Kikuchi-sensei will be joining us 
for an explanation from the vendors.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.810
Okay. I'll attend that.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.280
We're ready,

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.160
but we need the president 
for the opening remarks.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:42.140
Let's do everything we can.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.550
With our combined strength.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.500
I'm uneasy, too.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.160
But for the president as well,

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.500
we have to see the festival 
through to the after party.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.770
It's all we can do.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.210
He promised to bring her back, huh?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.330
We have a crazy number of attendees

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.300
because they heard good 
things about the festival.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.690
There must be twice as many as yesterday.

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:10.520
Sasaki.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.470
Yes?

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.370
Where have you been until now?

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.130
What?

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:18.580
We could use even your help right now.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.610
Uh, I had a stomachache or something...

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.860
I-I was in the bathroom?

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.140
B-But, Mika-san, you—

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.550
I-It's nothing!

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:39.660
Okay, let's keep working 
until the after party!

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.250
Welcome back, master.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.670
Have a seat here.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.260
Thanks for waiting.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.010
Here are your ARKS parfait and ARKS pancakes.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.990
That's one Monomate Drink, one Guts Drink,

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.420
and one Rappy's Oracle Tea.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:59.270
We're so busy, it's making me dizzy.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.470
Where did Kayano go?

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:04.340
We're already short-staffed 
with Ai-Ai missing.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.620
I seriously can't believe him.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.850
Sorry I'm late!

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:09.530
What?

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:14.160
I have descended to fill the gap 
left by the ace maid Suzuki Aika!

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.180
Both our café and the soothing moments
of our masters will be kept safe

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.290
by me, Kaya-Kaya!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:24.360
No way.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.040
Ai-Ai...

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.800
Please come back!

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.090
How are we going to save Rina-senpai?

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.500
We'll have to enter it.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.100
Enter the Dark Falz?

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.420
The Dark Falz is currently inactive due to
the damage inflicted by the photon laser.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.610
We believe it's regenerating itself.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.110
Things have gone according to plan so far.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:49.760
Where is the main force?

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.310
They'll be arriving shortly.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.750
We'll annihilate it once they arrive.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:58.950
Yes?

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.170
Aika,

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.210
we'll begin attacking 
with the main force soon.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:07.120
Once you meet up with the other ARKS,
you'll follow orders and—

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.050
Are you sure?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.170
Let's go.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.880
How will we get closer to it?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.180
I'll clear the way!

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.350
Itsuki!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.350
Got it!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.800
<i>This isn't too bad.</i>

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:34.610
Sing, ring...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.170
Florenberg!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:39.370
Go!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.940
All right. Now, then...

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.590
They're here.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:59.350
Honestly, not even I know
what's going on inside the Dark Falz.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.850
I have no idea where Rina might be.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.710
Then how will I find Rina-senpai?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.500
You'll have to feel her presence.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.360
This is...

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:39.890
Oh, no.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.020
Aika-chan!

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.210
Matoi-sama.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.200
Thank you.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.150
Aika-chan, you're serious about this.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.920
One last thing.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.390
Don't let the darkness swallow you.

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:15.170
The darkness?

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.750
It enters the bodies of ARKS 
skilled with photon arts.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.210
It will come for you.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:23.640
And if it does, you'll become 
part of the Dark Falz, too.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.620
Rina-senpai...

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.440
Tachibana-kun.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.270
What?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.020
Rina-senpai, what is this?

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.700
Why are you making that face?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.730
You can't be serious!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:49.330
The Dark Falz and after party are back, and...

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.460
I have no idea what's going on anymore!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.710
Then, let's go together.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.970
O-Okay.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.450
<b>[Genesis Weapon]</b>
Single-use weapons created at huge cost.
 Their strength is clearly greater
 than that of ready-made items,
and some even grant powers
such as invisibility to their users.
Because they're difficult to use and cause great strain to their users,
only special ARKS such as the
Council of Six are permitted to use them.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:27.870
<b>[AIS]</b> The Arks Interception Silhouette.
A humanoid weapon developed by
the ARKS research division.
Standing ten meters tall,
they're ORACLE's strongest fighting force controlled by ARKS pilots.
But they can't be piloted too long,
and doing so carries the risk
of being consumed by Darkers
and running out of control.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.850
Don't let the darkness swallow you.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.580
Wake up, Itsuki.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.310
Itsuki!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.960
Tachibana-kun...

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.010
Itsuki!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.560
Ready?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.020
Not yet.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.250
Ready?

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:06.960
Not yet.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.020
Ready?

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.160
Not yet.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.910
Ready?

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.380
Ready.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.670
<i>Why am I thinking about the past?</i>

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:21.120
See you later.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:21.860
Bye bye.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:22.660
Later.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:23.930
Bye.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.400
I personally don't enjoy 
hide and seek, though.

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:36.060
I was an easily forgotten child.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.180
I found you.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.580
I found you.

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:14.960
Senpai,

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.440
the after party is starting.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:20.440
Everyone's desperately
 keeping the festival going.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.690
They're going to make the 
after party a success.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:28.820
Masaya-senpai, Konoe-san, 
Seiya-san, Mayu-san, Yu-chan...

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.830
But what are they going to do if the 
person who suggested it isn't there?

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.130
President.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.750
Senpai.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.840
Rina!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.600
The Dark Falz...

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:07.360
Rina!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.870
Itsuki!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.880
Rina.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.790
Thank you

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.390
for finding me.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.640
Let's go home.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.550
Thanks for waiting.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.560
Itsuki, Rina.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.620
The strength to dispel the 
darkness and clear a path!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:35.330
The light of hope that 
illuminates the future!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.580
And all our bonds and feelings
 poured into this one attack!

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.660
Open the door to a new world!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.460
Star

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:58.880
Gazer!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.250
Where's the Dark Falz?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.740
It's impossible to take it out completely.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.510
It will appear again eventually.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:37.200
Suzuki-san, what in the world is going on?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.700
Itsuki can fill you in on the details.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.270
This is where we part ways.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.380
What?

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:46.910
Why?

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:49.520
We prevented the Dark Falz's invasion of Earth.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.060
That was my mission on Earth.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.640
And I completed it.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.880
What? At least attend 
the after party with us.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:16:59.650
What? Aika—

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.410
Is this what you wanted?

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.220
The remnants of the Dark Falz...

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.410
I won't let it reach Rina and Itsuki!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:23.810
<i>At 5:30 PM today,</i>

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:27.060
<i>we will be holding an 
after party on field two.</i>

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.530
<i>After party staff of all clubs, 
please gather at the field.</i>

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.380
<i>How did the confession go?</i>

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.470
<i>You'll pay if you made Mr. Aloof cry.</i>

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.070
<i>I'm in this party because I'm 
excited to hear about that.</i>

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:43.320
<i>You'd better tell us how it goes.</i>

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.250
<i>Or did she already give you an answer?</i>

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.080
<i>What it "sorry," after all?</i>

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.720
What am I supposed to say?

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:51.390
What's wrong?

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:53.840
Never mind! It's nothing!

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.970
Now, let's go.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.720
Yeah.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.560
Everybody, yay!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.980
Yay!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:14.480
The embarrassment and stiffness 
in that raised fist are so great.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.740
I wanted to feel connected to all of you

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.370
Right, Itsuki?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.740
Huh?

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.490
by making the school festival a success.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.490
No, I did.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.500
There's no need for long speeches anymore.

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.500
I have only one thing to say.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:32.060
Thank you, everyone!

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:34.010
You're the best!

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:38.880
Let the Seiga Academy after party begin!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:40.050
Cue.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.230
She didn't come.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:26.300
No.

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.930
Will we see her again?

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:45.600
<i>My everyday life went back to normal,
like nothing had changed.</i>

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.700
<i>Actually, if anything changed,</i>

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:54.210
<i>it was that, since the day of the school festival,
I lost my ability to enter ORACLE.</i>

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.210
Let's get this offline meeting started.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:06.180
<i>And I never saw Aika again.</i>

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:21.960
Thanks for a great three years.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.140
Itsuki-kun.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.240
Rina-senpai.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:38.750
Congratulations on graduating.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.930
The student council is in your hands.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:43.760
I can't believe I'm the president.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:47.260
It's okay. You'll have Mika and the others.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:52.030
I'm not confident I'll be able to control them.

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:54.610
If you ever need help, call me.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:55.270
What?

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.770
Online or offline.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:20.300
Rina.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.980
Suzuki-san!

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.850
Congratulations on graduating.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.450
Thanks...

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:36.940
You're back?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.240
No, I have a mission.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:43.070
A mission? So you're leaving again?

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:45.350
We can see each other anytime,

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.180
as long as you're still ARKS.

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:57.080
<i>Online games are bridges that 
connect our feelings to reality.</i>

00:21:57.490 --> 00:22:00.930
<i>Even if we're far apart, anyone can connect.</i>

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:03.340
<i>Anyone can become a hero.</i>

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:06.940
<i>And new connections are born.</i>

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:10.040
<i>Now, let's open the gate!</i>
